WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:04.950
The Black Beauty Sisters wanted to rule over the oceans, and had sent us a challenge.

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.680
Accepting it, we headed towards the sea.

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:13.930
Using the power of Gaito's stolen pearls, we were trapped by their powered-up attacks.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:18.800
At that time, Aqua Regina-sama appeared, and thus a new melody was born.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:22.440
We defeated the sisters using our new powers,

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:24.500
but at the same time, Gaito's lair...

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:29.160
Hey, Rina. Could that be...

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:32.500
Yeah, it's Gaito's lair.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:33.950
How can it be...

00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:37.270
Our opponent purposely appeared in front of us.

00:02:37.700 --> 00:02:38.600
Taki-san.

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:42.690
The time has finally arrived, hasn't it?

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:48.980
Darkness of the Heart.

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:07.960
I never would've thought that Gaito-sama's younger brother was in the human world.

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:11.170
It seems his consciousness is really hazy.

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:12.600
Lucia...

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:20.040
He still has memories of the time he spent in the human world.

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:24.320
As long as he stays by Gaito-sama's side, those memories will soon disappear.

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:29.190
It's about time, Sara.

00:03:29.190 --> 00:03:31.880
I have now obtained all of the pearls.

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:33.960
The time to rule the land has come.

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:38.620
Gaito, you can finally obtain the light of the land.

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:39.720
Light, huh?

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:40.810
Scared?

00:03:40.810 --> 00:03:41.700
Fool.

00:03:42.190 --> 00:03:44.630
Darkness is the other side of light.

00:03:44.630 --> 00:03:47.310
Both of them should belong to me.

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:52.310
You've been trapped in the darkness of the sea for a long time.

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:54.210
The right is yours.

00:03:54.850 --> 00:03:58.210
Kaito is uninteresting with his human heart.

00:03:58.210 --> 00:04:00.690
I want you to dispose of him quickly.

00:04:01.030 --> 00:04:06.320
Hey, if they purposely appeared in front of us, could this mean they're luring us in!?

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:07.350
Seems like it.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:11.120
It seems that the opponent is serious this time.

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:13.560
How should we deal with their actions?

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:16.900
We'll go, of course.

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:19.940
Because Noelle is trapped there.

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:20.760
Yeah.

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:23.710
Sara-sama and Coco-sama must be there, too.

00:04:23.710 --> 00:04:25.760
And Tarou-chan as well.

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:30.250
Lucia, what's wrong?

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:31.780
Kaito...

00:04:31.780 --> 00:04:34.020
I think I heard Kaito calling for me.

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:42.530
Is it painful, my other self?

00:04:43.740 --> 00:04:44.920
Rest assured.

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:50.740
If you obtain the power of the Mermaid Princesses' pearls, that pain will disappear.

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:54.010
The power of the pearls...

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:59.240
Right. This time, a world without pain will be in our hands.

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:12.160
Everyone, take care.

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:14.570
You must return.

00:05:14.570 --> 00:05:17.220
I'll be waiting for your return by cooking some of my delicious stew.

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:22.070
We will definitely return with all seven Mermaid Princesses.

00:05:22.070 --> 00:05:25.000
Let's get everyone back so we can all eat Nikora's stew, okay?

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:49.530
Mitsuki... The Mermaid Princesses are coming.

00:05:59.470 --> 00:06:02.810
How do we get into the castle?

00:06:02.810 --> 00:06:05.340
They're really inconsiderate.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:07.600
They should at least welcome us.

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:09.380
Anyway, let's find an entrance.

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:27.330
Gaito-sama, it's about time.

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:31.050
The light of Mermaid Princesses' seven colored pearls...

00:06:31.050 --> 00:06:33.300
...is nearly in your grasp.

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:37.710
Come, let's invite the Mermaid Princesses to the Mirror World.

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:40.410
Your wish is my command, Gaito-sama.

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:43.010
Lucia, Lucia!

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:45.400
Get a hold of yourself! Lucia!

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:46.360
Rina...

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:48.490
You're awake, Lucia.

00:06:48.490 --> 00:06:49.540
Where are we?

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:51.320
It seems we're in Gaito's lair.

00:06:51.320 --> 00:06:53.760
What a rough welcoming.

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.870
They really don't have any manners!

00:06:56.530 --> 00:06:59.150
Nee-sama, where are you!?

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:01.700
Welcome, Mermaid Princesses.

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:02.920
Gaito!

00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:05.680
You don't know how long I've waited for this day.

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:10.040
The day when the Mermaid Princesses' seven pearls will be mine.

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:13.810
Who says we're going to hand our precious pearls to you!?

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:15.400
Come out, Gaito!

00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:16.710
Show yourself!

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:19.500
Release Nee-san and our friends!

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:21.280
Noelle! Coco!

00:07:21.280 --> 00:07:22.520
Where are you!?

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:23.620
Yoo-hoo!

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:27.390
We've come to welcome you.

00:07:27.390 --> 00:07:31.400
You should thank us, Mermaid Princesses.

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:33.050
It's you again.

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:37.740
Stop following Gaito's orders and think about your own happiness.

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:39.400
Stop talking crap.

00:07:39.970 --> 00:07:42.770
You don't understand a thing about Gaito-sama!

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:48.810
To us who live in the deep, dark sea, Gaito-sama is far more important than anything.

00:07:48.810 --> 00:07:51.390
The likes of you could never understand.

00:07:51.390 --> 00:07:53.280
Y-Yuuri-san.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:54.950
Prepare yourselves!

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:57.920
Lucia, Karen, Hippo!

00:07:58.420 --> 00:07:59.940
Leave this to Hanon and me!

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:01.060
Go look for Noelle and the others!

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:02.850
Understood, Rina!

00:08:02.850 --> 00:08:03.900
I'm leaving this to you!

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:05.230
Roger!

00:08:05.900 --> 00:08:07.430
We won't let you escape!

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:08.310
Leave them.

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:12.670
We have the advantage if they're scattered.

00:08:12.670 --> 00:08:14.340
We'll take them on, one by one.

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:15.980
You're right.

00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:20.780
What's with them!? When did they have so much confidence, Rina!?

00:08:20.780 --> 00:08:23.670
They purposely lured us into the castle.

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:25.780
They must have set up a few traps beforehand.

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:28.250
Hanon, be on your guard.

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:32.530
Noelle, Coco.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:34.120
Where on earth are you two?

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:39.200
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:41.050
Green Pearl Voice!

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:43.910
We'll give you some special service today.

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:46.570
A special duet with Rina and I.

00:08:47.350 --> 00:08:49.970
Pichi Pichi Voice, Live Start!

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:24.440
It's useless.

00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:28.890
Your song has no effect within Gaito's lair.

00:09:28.890 --> 00:09:32.880
Gaito-sama's barrier protects us from your noise.

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:34.550
H-How can that be...

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:36.220
Our songs won't work!

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:46.260
The door is opening.

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:49.170
This could be a trap laid by the enemy.

00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:52.500
Even so, we have to save everyone.

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:53.880
Let's go, Karen.

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:54.740
Yeah.

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:05.150
Coco! Noelle!

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:08.260
Nee-san! Nee-san!

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:12.220
Karen-san, please move aside.

00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:21.030
The key was originally my staff.

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:32.240
Noelle... My sister...

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:36.380
I've always wanted to meet you... always.

00:10:36.380 --> 00:10:37.570
Nee-san!

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:41.180
Karen?

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:42.720
Nee-san!

00:10:42.720 --> 00:10:45.190
You're Karen, right?

00:10:46.130 --> 00:10:49.060
I've always wanted to meet you.

00:10:49.060 --> 00:10:50.990
My younger sister...

00:10:50.990 --> 00:10:52.400
Nee-san!

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:55.600
Nee-san! Nee-san!

00:10:55.600 --> 00:10:57.870
Karen... my younger sister...

00:11:00.140 --> 00:11:03.070
I'm glad for both of them.

00:11:13.120 --> 00:11:14.520
Lovers Ice Darts!

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:17.190
Take this!

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:19.920
There's still more to come!

00:11:21.390 --> 00:11:22.440
Go!

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:27.710
Hanon! Let's retreat for now!

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:29.530
Yes, I got it!

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:31.940
Stop right there!

00:11:38.350 --> 00:11:40.470
Are you okay, Coco!

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:44.650
You're a Mermaid Princess...

00:11:44.650 --> 00:11:46.230
I'm Lucia.

00:11:46.230 --> 00:11:49.220
Mermaid Princess of the North Pacific Ocean.

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:51.320
Were you the one who saved me?

00:11:51.320 --> 00:11:52.220
Yes.

00:11:52.680 --> 00:11:55.560
Thank you for saving me, Lucia.

00:11:56.260 --> 00:11:59.600
But I don't deserve to be saved.

00:12:00.600 --> 00:12:03.790
Coco, what do you mean?

00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:07.210
Long ago, when Sara lost Mitsuki-san,

00:12:07.210 --> 00:12:11.580
she was so grief stricken that the power of her pearl went out of control.

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:20.450
The negative energy brought a great calamity upon herself and upon my country.

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:26.360
I, who had always stayed by Sara's side, couldn't even manage to help her.

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:27.910
You aren't the one at fault-

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:31.790
No! I couldn't stop Sara's pearl from going crazy.

00:12:32.610 --> 00:12:34.630
And then Sara grew close to Gaito.

00:12:34.630 --> 00:12:38.700
All the while, Gaito had me trapped and powerless in this castle.

00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:41.820
I'm sorry, Sara.

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:44.150
I'm sorry, everyone.

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:50.350
Lucia. Why are you crying?

00:12:50.350 --> 00:12:55.350
Because... Sara and Coco have suffered so many hardships...

00:12:55.350 --> 00:12:59.860
And yet I knew nothing, and did nothing to help you...

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:02.660
Lucia. You are really kind...

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:05.670
Sorry. I'm sorry, Coco.

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:07.030
Lucia.

00:13:10.370 --> 00:13:12.040
Sara!

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:15.310
You have awakened, my dear Coco.

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:18.540
Sara, let's start our lives all over again.

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:20.310
Let's live together with these girls...

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:22.890
Start our lives over, you say?

00:13:22.890 --> 00:13:26.390
Yes, you can see they've come to save us.

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:28.590
Fools.

00:13:29.930 --> 00:13:35.150
Coco, do you really think you can take back what's been lost?

00:13:35.150 --> 00:13:35.860
Sara.

00:13:35.860 --> 00:13:39.830
My country. And all of your countries, too.

00:13:40.940 --> 00:13:44.420
The deep dark sea has already stained my heart with darkness.

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:46.500
And so, I have been reborn.

00:13:47.210 --> 00:13:49.120
Then, I noticed something.

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:55.910
A great power within me, more powerful than love, courage, or hope.

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:57.270
Sara.

00:13:57.270 --> 00:14:01.390
You look at me with such pitiful eyes, Coco.

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:05.920
That's right. I'm not a Mermaid Princess anymore!

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:08.220
Sara, that's not true!

00:14:08.220 --> 00:14:11.960
Yes, you're only suffering right now.

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:14.360
But it's alright now.

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:17.250
Because you have us supporting you.

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:20.400
Could it be that you aren't afraid of me?

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:23.540
Yes! Because we are friends, aren't we?

00:14:23.540 --> 00:14:25.210
Friends?

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:28.150
Then let me tell you something.

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:31.780
I have thrown away my heart, and this is the real me.

00:14:43.920 --> 00:14:45.830
Where am I?

00:14:48.230 --> 00:14:49.900
You're Gaito!

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:52.640
Yes, I'm Gaito.

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:55.140
And I'm also your beloved Kaito.

00:14:55.140 --> 00:14:56.570
What are you saying!?

00:14:56.570 --> 00:14:58.810
How can you be Kaito!

00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:04.750
Kaito and I... have already joined as one.

00:15:07.570 --> 00:15:09.360
A crack has appeared in the crystal!

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:10.650
T-This is bad.

00:15:10.650 --> 00:15:12.700
Taki-san, what do you mean!?

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:18.800
In ancient times, the elder of the Panterassa was known to have the power to make people's hearts waver.

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:22.970
Now Lucia could be facing that power.

00:15:23.640 --> 00:15:24.640
How can that be...

00:15:24.640 --> 00:15:31.980
If that's true, what Lucia has to fight isn't the enemy, but her own heart.

00:15:38.180 --> 00:15:39.780
K-Kaito!

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:41.790
Are you really Kaito?

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:44.220
What are you saying, Lucia?

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:46.980
If I'm not Kaito, then who do you think I am?

00:15:46.980 --> 00:15:50.830
B-But Kaito is in Hawaii.

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:54.030
I came back for your sake, Lucia.

00:15:54.030 --> 00:15:56.330
Then, you're really Kaito, right!?

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:59.670
Yeah, that's right, Lucia.

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:05.210
Kaito...

00:16:06.180 --> 00:16:07.580
Where did you go?

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:13.550
Kaito, my younger brother.

00:16:14.020 --> 00:16:17.910
You were separated from me when we were born.

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:21.890
I've had to live in this dark deep sea all alone.

00:16:21.890 --> 00:16:23.690
I had nothing!

00:16:24.030 --> 00:16:27.360
You were taken away from me, and then I was sealed in darkness.

00:16:27.360 --> 00:16:30.150
And the ones who did it were none other than the Mermaid Princesses!

00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:32.740
Mermaid Princess...

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:37.480
My younger brother, we must get our hands on the Mermaid Princesses' pearls this time.

00:16:37.480 --> 00:16:40.380
And then we'll take back the light once again!

00:16:40.960 --> 00:16:42.050
Kaito.

00:16:42.740 --> 00:16:43.710
Lucia.

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:45.570
Kaito!

00:16:45.570 --> 00:16:46.700
Lucia...

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:50.760
What's wrong, Kaito?

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:52.020
Are you in pain!?

00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:54.110
Lucia... I beg you...

00:16:54.650 --> 00:16:57.560
Give me your pearl.

00:16:57.560 --> 00:17:01.970
Lucia. This place is really dark... really cold.

00:17:02.520 --> 00:17:04.900
I need your pearl.

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:08.470
Kaito, is this the pearl you need?

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:11.730
Yes.

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:14.880
Give the pearl to me quickly.

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:16.990
Kaito.

00:17:16.990 --> 00:17:18.550
Are you really Kaito!?

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:20.450
Hand the pearl over to me now!

00:17:20.960 --> 00:17:23.450
No, you aren't Kaito!

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:25.460
You aren't Kaito!

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:26.920
Hand the pearl over to me.

00:17:30.760 --> 00:17:32.760
Save me, Kaito!

00:17:34.770 --> 00:17:38.300
LUCIA!!!!

00:17:41.130 --> 00:17:42.380
That bastard.

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:47.080
This light... This warm light is...

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:48.020
Kaito!

00:17:57.670 --> 00:17:58.660
Kaito...

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:01.990
Pink Pearl Mermaid Princess.

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:07.000
If you continue to defy me, you will be trapped in here, alone forever.

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:10.470
There is no one and nothing else here.

00:18:10.470 --> 00:18:13.800
No one can come here, and you can't leave.

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:16.440
No one will come and save you.

00:18:16.920 --> 00:18:20.610
Your Mermaid Princess friends and Kaito will not come.

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:22.820
That...

00:18:22.820 --> 00:18:23.920
That isn't true!

00:18:23.920 --> 00:18:25.220
Everyone will come!

00:18:25.220 --> 00:18:26.980
They will come and save me!

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:29.390
Fool.

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:35.830
I believe that everyone will come for me.

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:38.210
I believe in them!

00:18:50.670 --> 00:18:51.740
Everyone!

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:54.080
Are you alright, Lucia?

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:56.350
How did you know I was here?

00:18:56.350 --> 00:18:58.050
Your pearl called us here.

00:18:58.050 --> 00:19:00.680
Here. Coco-sama, Noelle-sama.

00:19:00.680 --> 00:19:02.350
Here are your pearls.

00:19:08.190 --> 00:19:10.560
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:14.510
Purple Pearl Voice!

00:19:16.780 --> 00:19:18.940
Indigo Pearl Voice!

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:23.340
Yellow Pearl Voice!

00:20:02.980 --> 00:20:06.250
Curse you, Mermaid Princesses!

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:10.890
The light of our six pearls will never lose to the shadows.

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:13.490
We will illuminate your darkness!

00:20:13.490 --> 00:20:16.460
Pichi Pichi Voice, Live Start!

00:21:40.640 --> 00:21:43.110
Lover Shower Pitch!

00:21:49.750 --> 00:21:53.490
Mermaid Princesses, your efforts are wasted.

00:21:53.490 --> 00:21:55.160
W-Why...

00:21:55.160 --> 00:21:57.830
Our song didn't work against Gaito!?

00:21:57.830 --> 00:22:02.690
It doesn't matter how much you sing, with only your six pearls.

00:22:02.690 --> 00:22:06.540
You can't win against me as long you're missing the final pearl.

00:22:07.230 --> 00:22:12.010
Mermaid Princesses, have a taste of my hatred!

00:23:50.840 --> 00:23:52.930
The time for the final battle has finally arrived.

00:23:52.930 --> 00:23:56.610
Yeah, in due time, everything will belong to Gaito-sama.

00:23:56.610 --> 00:24:00.050
We have been powered up by Gaito-sama's powers.

